{title: Dil Dhoondta Hai (Fast)}
{artist: Bhupinder Singh Madan Mohan Lata Mangeshkar}
{key: D#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[D#m] [F#],        dil dhundata hai, phir wahi
[C#] [D#m],        fursat ke raat din
[C#] [D#m],        baithe rahe tasawwoor-ye-jana kiye huye
[A#] [G#] [Fm] [A#]
jaadon ki narma dhup aur aangan me let kar
[G#] [F#] [G#] [D#m]
aankho pe khinch kar tere aanchal ke saaye ko
[D#m] [C#] [D#m],        aundhe pade rahe kabhee karawat liye huye
[A#] [G#] [Fm] [A#]
yaa gamreeyon kee raat jo purawaiyan chale
[G#] [F#] [G#] [D#m],        thhandee safed chaadaro pe jaage der tak
[D#m] [C#] [D#m]
taaron ko dekhate rahe chhat par pade huye
[A#] [G#] [Fm] [A#],        barfeeli sardiyon me kisi bhi pahaad par
[G#] [F#] [G#] [D#m],        waadi me gunjati huyi khamoshiyan sune
[D#m] [C#] [D#m]
aankho me bheeege bhige se lamhe liye huye
